---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/founder-habits-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/founder-habits-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={560}
  caption="The four founder reflexes I had to unlearn: the reflex I broke (left), the one I built in its place (right)."
>
  Four founder reflexes I had to unlearn at the operator boundary. Fix it
  yourself becomes name the owner and let them work. Fastest path to the answer
  becomes the slower path through the team. Strongest opinion first becomes ask
  first, opinion last. All-hands runs tactical becomes all-hands runs strategic.
</Diagram>
